Bark 3.0 Clean is a low-bit, disfluency-removing fine-tune by Conway Research of
NVIDIA's parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3 speech recognition model, through Moondream's
parakeet-ultra and Underdog Bark 3.0 Plus. Nexus did not modify the weights.

