Revision: 541d1f99c6b0c3cd0b11a95167540bb8edefd82b
Licensed CC-BY-4.0. No NVIDIA weights are downloaded.

The files are downloaded separately after user confirmation, each checked against
a pinned size and SHA-256; they are not included in the Nexus distribution. The
.bark container is read as data by nexus/voice/bark.py (the method follows the
upstream bark_loader.py, CC-BY-4.0); no upstream code is downloaded or executed.
Nexus performs local inference with the separately installed Transformers, Torch
and constriction packages, under their own license terms.
